Z||000000||85seNUT||08-12-2001||02:59 AM||||My car passed emisions but wouldnt pass smog...why u ask?  cuz my car kept idling higher than 1,100rpm's!!!!!  So i was like dang is there a way to fix it .... um der sims loke facume leeek(he was asian, no offense)  so i left it there,  came back 4 hours later.  it was done.  passed smog.  the car didnt have a shaky idle.  but he said he cleaned the throttle body and adjusted the timing,  so now my car didnt idle weird,  but what is weird is it seems a lot harder to drive(4 spd, like it jerks a lot more) and it also seems like i lost a lot of power(well maybe just a little, but still)  but i might be getting better gas millage.  hmmmmmmm   whats up with this funky stuff?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Oreif||08-12-2001||05:21 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 85seNUT:<BR><B>So i was like dang is there a way to fix it .... um der sims loke facume leeek(he was asian, no offense)  so i left it there,  came back 4 hours later.  it was done.  passed smog.  the car didnt have a shaky idle.  but he said he cleaned the throttle body and adjusted the timing,  so now my car didnt idle weird</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You left the car there for them to mess with? Sounds like he messed up your timing. I would re-check the timing. Also if he "cleaned " the throttle body he may have clogged some of the vacuum ports holes. I would look at the IAC ports and seat too.<BR>||||reg||1
